      </table>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Vertical-fit scores (1-10) rate how well each tool is built for the trade, checked against the trades the vendor's own pages say it serves. See <a href="/methodology/" class="underline">methodology</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Switching between them</h2>
    <p>
      Both import customers from a CSV file. Our data does not record which other records either one imports or exports. Before you switch, ask both vendors which records move (customers, jobs, invoices, recurring work, price books), in which file format, and whether they help with the import, and ask whether customers' saved cards can move to the new payment processor or must be collected again.
